//   position = sum of weight x bone applied to (scaled x, y, z, 1)
//   (raw_blocks::model_space); normals with the bones' 3x3 parts.
// uWorld (3 rows), uView (3 rows), uProj (4 rows): the GE's matrices, row by
//   row (frame.rs RawTransform::world, RawCamera::view, ::projection).
// uFog: view z factor, FOG_END, FOG_SCALE: fog = (view z x .x + .y) x .z
//   (0, 1, 1 without fog: 1 = none).
// uViewport: origin x, y, scale x, y (RawCamera::viewport).
// uMaterial, uAmbient, uEmissive, uColors: frame.rs RawColors: colours as
//   whole numbers 0..255; uColors = (lighting, opaque, replace, doubled
//   alpha: blend factor "doubled source alpha", the vertex alpha doubled
//   instead, at most 255, after opaque and before replace).
// uScale: blend factor FIX A (frame.rs RawColors::scale): w > 0.5: last of
//   all, RGB = floor(RGB x uScale.rgb / 255) (blend.rs scale_color).
//   Lighting 3 (raw_vertex.rs lighting::LIGHTS): the vertex colour (white
//   without one) lit with directional lights (uLights, the light set, 22
//   float4, GpuLights) by its normal taken to world space with uWorld's 3x3
